{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":2637,"name":"Toufeeq  Pasha","username":"Toufeeq_Pasha","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.availproject.org/toufeeq_pasha/{size}/858_2.png","created_at":"2024-09-29T09:50:54.452Z","cooked":"\u003caside\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eReport Author:\u003c/strong\u003e Toufeeq from the Avail Technical Committee [5CoVaWrZnaV3BSeUJCA8Ca3SPMJDtjT1zPvZkzovkxJU7dkr]\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eChanges to be Executed:\u003c/strong\u003e Changes will be applied at block \u003cspan class=\"hashtag-raw\"\u003e#388\u003c/span\u003e,929\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTechnical Committee Consensus:\u003c/strong\u003e 5/7 signers \u003ca href=\"https://avail.subscan.io/tech/13?tab=proposal\"\u003ehttps://avail.subscan.io/tech/13?tab=proposal\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/aside\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIntroduction:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis document aims to provide transparency to the Avail community concerning upcoming and executed network changes. The Technical Committee (TC) has thoroughly assessed the proposed DA fee changes for the Avail mainnet. After carefully considering their effectiveness, potential impact, execution parameters, and security implications, the TC has reached a majority consensus of 5/7.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProposed / Executed Changes:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe proposal was introduced and discussed in the community through \u003ca href=\"https://forum.availproject.org/t/aip-3-decrease-fees-to-testnet-levels/1526\"\u003eAIP 3\u003c/a\u003e on the Avail forum. Submitted by the Fee Pricing Committee (FPC), which is responsible for setting and recommending data submission fees on the network, the proposal aims to reduce the DA transaction weight fee by a factor of 10.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCode Modifications:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nNone\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePotential Merits to the Network:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe primary security consideration of lowering the data posting fees is the risk of additional spam. Based on testing on the Turing, the committee believes that the risk of spam is minimal at the recommended fee levels.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf you need any additional resources or information, please feel free to leave a comment.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThank you.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":1,"updated_at":"2024-09-29T09:50:54.452Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":11,"reads":10,"readers_count":9,"score":87.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":1547,"topic_slug":"transparency-report-4-reducing-da-fees-to-turing-levels","display_username":"Toufeeq  Pasha","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://forum.availproject.org/t/aip-3-decrease-fees-to-testnet-levels/1526","internal":true,"reflection":false,"title":"AIP 3: Decrease fees to testnet levels","clicks":3},{"url":"https://avail.subscan.io/tech/13?tab=proposal","internal":false,"reflection":false,"clicks":1}],"read":true,"user_title":"Avail Technical Committee","title_is_group":false,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":2}],"moderator":true,"admin":false,"staff":true,"user_id":999,"hidden":false,"trust_level":1,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/transparency-report-4-reducing-da-fees-to-turing-levels/1547/1","reactions":[{"id":"heart","type":"emoji","count":2}],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":2,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":fa